Subject: [PATCH] Log how the group roster stands: states, connected devices
 and their PIDs

A callee that heard nobody in a group call applied rosters with no connected
remote device carrying a PID, so only the fallback receiver stayed. Nothing in
the log said what the server's rosters held. The summary counts participants by
state and connected devices with and without PID, naming no one.
